{"Title":"An Act designating a certain bridge in the town of Ashland as the Harold Wadhams Gates memorial bridge","BillNumber":"H3883","DocketNumber":"HD4114","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"JPL1","Name":"Jack Patrick Lewis","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JPL1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-27T11:34:11.5"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"JPL1","Name":"Jack Patrick Lewis","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JPL1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-27T11:34:11.5"},{"Id":"PAS1","Name":"Paul A. Schmid III","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/PAS1","ResponseDate":"2023-08-23T16:38:56.83"}],"JointSponsor":{"Id":"PAS1","Name":"Paul A. Schmid III","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/PAS1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-27T11:34:11.5"},"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H3883/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representatives Lewis of Framingham and Schmid of Westport, a petition (subject to Joint Rule 12) of Jack Patrick Lewis and Paul A. Schmid, III for legislation to designate a certain bridge in the town of Ashland as the Harold Wadhams Gates memorial bridge.  Transportation.","DocumentText":"\tBridge number A-14-011 on Fountain street in the town of Ashland shall be designated and known as the Harold Wadhams Gates bridge in honor of his service during World War II. The Massachusetts Department of Transportation shall erect and maintain suitable bearing this designation in compliance with the standards of the department.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Suspend Rules","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H33","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H33"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J27","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J27"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Place in OD","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H52","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H52"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Correctly Drawn","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H36","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H36"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Correctly Drawn","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"S31","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/S31"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}